@startuml SQL_Server_UPDATE_Sequence

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam roundCorner 10

actor "Client Application\n(SSMS/App)" as Client
participant "Protocol Layer\n(TDS)" as TDS
participant "Parser" as Parser
participant "Algebrizer" as Algebrizer
participant "Optimizer" as Optimizer
participant "Plan Cache" as PlanCache
participant "Access Methods" as Access
participant "Buffer Manager" as Buffer
participant "Data Files" as Data
participant "Lock Manager" as LockMgr
participant "Transaction Manager" as TxnMgr
participant "Transaction Log" as TLog

== Parsing & Compilation ==

Client -> TDS : 1. Send UPDATE command
activate TDS
TDS -> Parser : 2. Parse SQL
deactivate TDS
activate Parser
Parser -> Algebrizer : 3. Create Parse Tree
deactivate Parser
activate Algebrizer
Algebrizer -> Optimizer : 4. Generate Logical Tree\n(Name resolution)
deactivate Algebrizer

== Optimization ==

activate Optimizer
Optimizer -> PlanCache : 5. Check for Cached Plan
PlanCache --> Optimizer : 6a. Return Cached Plan (if exists)
Optimizer -> Optimizer : 6b. Generate Plan\n(if cache miss)
deactivate Optimizer

== Execution ==

Optimizer -> Access : 7. Send Execution Plan
activate Access
Access -> Buffer : 8. Check Buffer Pool
activate Buffer
Buffer -> Data : 9. Disk Read if not in Buffer
deactivate Buffer

Access -> LockMgr : 10. Acquire IU/IX Locks
activate LockMgr
LockMgr --> Access : 11. Lock Granted
deactivate LockMgr

Access -> TxnMgr : 12. Begin Transaction
activate TxnMgr
TxnMgr -> TLog : 13. Log BEGIN_XACT
deactivate TxnMgr

Access -> TLog : 14. Log BEFORE image
Access -> Buffer : 15. Modify In-Memory Data
Access -> TLog : 16. Log AFTER image

TxnMgr -> TLog : 17. Write COMMIT
TxnMgr -> LockMgr : 18. Release Locks

== Completion ==

Access -> TDS : 19. Return "(1 row affected)"
deactivate Access
TDS -> Client : 20. Send Completion

note right of TLog
BEGIN_XACT, BEFORE image,\nAFTER image, COMMIT\nare all written to WAL
end note

@enduml
